\title{Conditional frontier and saturation analysis}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{measured-example}
\p{A finite matched study measures capability at selected values of one
declared cost. Its frontier and saturation target are conditional on that
protocol; they do not establish a universal intelligence law.}
